                                                                        <tr>
                                                                            <th>Brief Profile:</th>
                                                                            <td><p>Dr. Abhishek Mishra is an Assistant Professor at the School of Interdisciplinary and Transdisciplinary Studies (SOITS), IGNOU, since 4th September 2023. He specializes in Entrepreneurship, Human Resource Management (HRM), and Human Values and Ethics. With over five years of research and two years of teaching experience, he previously served as an ICSSR-funded Postdoctoral Fellow at Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar University, Lucknow. Dr. Mishra holds a Ph.D. in Management, where he explored leveraging human capital and material resources through insights from the *Shreemad Bhagavad Gita*.</p><p>
He has authored two books and contributed to several prestigious academic journals. At IGNOU, he also serves as one of the Programme Coordinators for MASSOL and has introduced innovative programmes, such as the Postgraduate Diploma and Master of Arts in Human Values and Ethics. Proficient in both quantitative and qualitative research methodologies, Dr. Mishra is dedicated to integrating modern management practices with ethical, human-centric education approaches.</p></td>
